<title>UK: HemaSure sues P&amp;U over plasma sale.</title>
<headline>HemaSure sues P&amp;U over plasma sale.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. medical group HemaSure has begun legal action against U.S.-Swedish drugs group Pharmacia &amp; Upjohn over the planned sale of P&amp;U's blood plasma division, P&amp;U said.</p>
<p>&quot;We know that a suit has been filed,&quot; said a spokesman for P&amp;U at its headquarters in Britain. He said it related to the blood plasma division but would not discuss details.</p>
</text>
